        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Siblings Lesha and Diana are close, but separated by miles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, they face difficulties in their cold, unfriendly cities, and their connection is maintained only through video calls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will they learn to appreciate each other in a new way after going through a series of dramatic events?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Our features</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- About 3 hours long narrative with a cosy, but at times tense atmosphere. Warm conversations are replaced by sad discoveries and ominous signs of fate that are yet to be unravelled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hand-drawn graphics with lots of CG art and backgrounds of wintertime St. Petersburg by experienced novel and anime artists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Professional voice acting by Ravencat studio — lifelike voices that bring the story even closer to your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Musical accompaniment — from classical motifs to relaxing LoFi tracks that emphasise the mood of the scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Many subtle, barely noticeable details, despite the dynamic plot. Choices inevitably change the story.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Siblings Lesha and Diana are close, but separated by miles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, they face difficulties in their cold, unfriendly cities, and their connection is maintained only through video calls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will they learn to appreciate each other in a new way after going through a series of dramatic events?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Our features</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- About 3 hours long narrative with a cosy, but at times tense atmosphere. Warm conversations are replaced by sad discoveries and ominous signs of fate that are yet to be unravelled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hand-drawn graphics with lots of CG art and backgrounds of wintertime St. Petersburg by experienced novel and anime artists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Professional voice acting by Ravencat studio — lifelike voices that bring the story even closer to your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Musical accompaniment — from classical motifs to relaxing LoFi tracks that emphasise the mood of the scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Many subtle, barely noticeable details, despite the dynamic plot. Choices inevitably change the story.</p>",
